{title: Pachamama hear us now}
{artist: Sunny Davidson}

Pachamama hear us now
Help us to remember how
To give thanks for all we have
We ask for guidance from you know
In the middle of the night
With the fire burning bright
And the shining stars above
Bring us your medicine of love

Giving thanks for the ancestors
Who look down from the stars
May their prayers and all their wisdom
Be received into our hearts
May the seven generations
Know the blessings of the fire
Their wellbeing and their healing
Is our greatest desire
